                                                "sense_id": "2520ee24-71e8-3168-8d3e-b00f40e3b999",
                                                "text": "mint choc chip ice cream; a box of chocs"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "576684ad-a32e-44f0-8638-23d8735bc7e7",
                        "source_entry_id": "8bd0a586-2a97-3d95-b0d4-d222b8f8f549",
                        "source_sense_id": "4270884a-74a2-3255-a5f7-50bb61de428e",
                        "source_sense_description": "umgangssprachlich, kurz für: Schokolade",
                        "target_lang_word": "choco",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "choco",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87e4d75d-f00a-3225-9bd8-c701d419f1b3",
                                        "entry_id": "cc9599de-d1db-362e-a497-a358d50c2596",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Clipping of chocolate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "clipping",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f736922-6531-488d-89fd-2f343f572729",
                                                "sense_id": "87e4d75d-f00a-3225-9bd8-c701d419f1b3",
                                                "text": "CHOCO MAYO CAKE\nIn this chocolate cake, mayonnaise is substituted for the butter. Good."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b47f160-e469-4fdf-9a28-02368ef26971",
                                                "sense_id": "87e4d75d-f00a-3225-9bd8-c701d419f1b3",
                                                "text": "Vision is a 2.7% sodium-fluoride containing prophylaxis paste available in 12 oz. jars or boxes of 225 individual cups. Three flavors (fruit punch, cool mint, or choco-mint) are available."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37062791-fb33-4d09-914b-cc9891958504",
                                                "sense_id": "87e4d75d-f00a-3225-9bd8-c701d419f1b3",
                                                "text": "She used to make choco pudding only for me whenever I went."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75d1b1fd-9c36-4f64-8100-3590a69cf0f0",
                                                "sense_id": "87e4d75d-f00a-3225-9bd8-c701d419f1b3",
                                                "text": "“D, you’ve had a weak spot for hot chocolate since you were small. You used to call it ‘choco-treat.’”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09066fdb-492a-3c59-9ecf-544d33c01bbc",
                                        "entry_id": "cc9599de-d1db-362e-a497-a358d50c2596",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A militiaman or conscript; chocolate soldier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5125ac6-d773-43fd-b644-2b68114e8d02",
                                                "sense_id": "09066fdb-492a-3c59-9ecf-544d33c01bbc",
                                                "text": "I've a letter here to hand,\n Saying Chockos, Yanks and Refugees\n Have overrun the land."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22849001-800c-4e73-ac91-9560e13f08e0",
                                                "sense_id": "09066fdb-492a-3c59-9ecf-544d33c01bbc",
                                                "text": "In the second war, militiamen and conscripts generally were called chocos, […] in a tribute to them the Sydney “Sun” headed a leader on 2 September 1942: “Chocos with Hard Centres”."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a51448ac-ee50-3579-afc0-594721eec9a2",
                                        "entry_id": "cc9599de-d1db-362e-a497-a358d50c2596",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An army reservist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "countable",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7cf6b132-c692-3bce-8d00-7cf9e9f81350",
                                        "entry_id": "cc9599de-d1db-362e-a497-a358d50c2596",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person with dark skin tone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "countable",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb721245-9aa6-490f-b08a-58e664d82147",
                                                "sense_id": "7cf6b132-c692-3bce-8d00-7cf9e9f81350",
                                                "text": "Our ethnic minorities whether they be oil slicks, chockos or slopies have certainly given a new dimension to the Australian businessman’s lunch."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b91d3a43-6fe5-4a06-ae11-e905055add1a",
                                                "sense_id": "7cf6b132-c692-3bce-8d00-7cf9e9f81350",
                                                "text": "And it’s better than ending up with the latest dag her Mum’s lined up. This one's called Petro. He’s a big choc, you know really woggy"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e10840e2-2463-4454-b254-48c0ec9c7ed4",
                                                "sense_id": "7cf6b132-c692-3bce-8d00-7cf9e9f81350",
                                                "text": "‘I reckon we’ll call you Choco,’ said the Rat. “With – that tan of yours.’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
